OL,3,GNEWSA'Near miss' in harbour after boat
OL,4,Aruns red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "near miss" between a passenger ship
OL,7,Fand a cruise ship tender took place
OL,8,Flast weekend, Guernsey Ports has said.
OL,10,FHarbour master James Way said a tender
OL,11,Fhad departed despite red signals being
OL,12,Fin place on Sunday at about 17:00 BST.
OL,14,FTender 14 from the cruise ship AIDAsol
OL,15,Fcrossed in front of the San Pawl ferry,
OL,16,Fwhich carries up to 310 foot passengers
OL,17,Fbetween Guernsey and Jersey.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
