OL,3,GNEWSA'Near miss' in harbour after boat
OL,4,Aruns red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FWay said while the boats had passed
OL,7,Feach other "at relatively close range",
OL,8,Fthere had been "no immediate danger or
OL,9,Fimpact on passenger or vessel safety"
OL,10,Fand the incident has been discussed
OL,11,Fwith the cruise operator.
